1. `cookie_num=5`，`msg[0..4]` 有效
2. `eat_cookie`：`idx=4`（自交换）→ `free(msg[4])`，`msg[4]` 悬空，`cookie_num=4`
   - `msg[4]` 悬空但超出范围（`cookie_num=4`，索引 4 >= 4）
3. `eat_cookie`：`idx=3`（自交换）→ `free(msg[3])`，`msg[3]` 悬空，`cookie_num=3`
